imary suite impresses with a vaulted ceiling, walk-in closet, ensuite & an additional room ideal for a 2nd closet, nursery or office. Two spacious bedrooms, one with a custom built-in library, plus a separate storage & linen room complete the 2nd floor. The fully finished basement features a large family room (easy to add a bedroom) & plenty of storage. Outside, enjoy the yard, stamped-concrete patio & oversized garage with extended rear parking. Visit the REALTOR®’s website for more details. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$975,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","2,028 sq ft"],["Year built","2007"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Glenora"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5N2H2"],["MLS® number","E4509609"],["Listed","September 20, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.06 m × 4.49 m (13'4\" × 14'9\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.26 m × 2.92 m (14'0\" × 9'7\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.09 m × 3.63 m (10'2\" × 11'11\")"],["Laundry room","Main level",""],["Recreation room","Basement",""]],"courtesy":"Matteo Saccomanno, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"glenora","area":"west-edmonton"}